    "reviewedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "notes": "Approved project-authored low-poly rider and full-suspension 29er e-bike asset. Public Pole Voima K2 dimensions and service packaging inform the measured chassis and independently authored silhouette. The fictional rider uses a generic low-poly face, dark beard and eyewear, blue-white clothing, and a white-black open-face enduro helmet with visor; it is not authored as a likeness of a named person. The wheels use independently authored large black front-grip and rear-braking tread silhouettes based on the publicly listed Maxxis tire roles. No Pole or Maxxis logos, source model surfaces, proprietary CAD, photograph pixels, face scan or texture is copied. No endorsement by Pole Bicycle Company or Maxxis is claimed or implied. Runtime poses are snapshot-driven and intentionally use no baked GLB animation or root motion."
